root(name, quizzers) ::= <<
# <name>: Quizzer Summary

| Place | Name | Team | Church | Average Score | Average Errors |
|-------|------|------|--------|---------------|-----------------|
<quizzers:rows(); separator="\n">

>>

rows(quizzer) ::= <<
| <if(quizzer.ShowPlace)><quizzer.Place><endif> | [<quizzer.SafeFullName>](quizzers/<quizzer.Id>.md)<if(quizzer.IsRookie)> (R)<endif> | [<quizzer.SafeTeamName>](teams/<quizzer.Team.Id>.md) | <quizzer.SafeChurchName> | <quizzer.AverageScore; format="F2"> | <quizzer.AverageErrors; format="F2"> |
>>
